<title>USA: Jack Henry &amp; Associates Year audited net.</title>
<headline>Jack Henry &amp; Associates Year audited net.</headline>
<dateline>MONETT, Mo. 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jack Henry &amp; Associates Inc, in reporting audited results for the fiscal year ended June 30, said its loss from discontinued operations for the 1996 quarter was $0.21 per share, revised from an unaudited $0.13 per share previously reported.</p>
<p>Audited full-year results follow:</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.77		    $0.66</p>
<p> Net			  9,648		    7,978</p>
<p> Revs			67,558		   46,124</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,484		   12,049</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year results include loss of $2.6 million or $0.21 per share from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
